flowchart TD
  A["1. ARM
You deposit 1 BB + 1 PLATINUM,
choose the heir and period (90 to 3,650 days)
and approve the tokens to protect"]
  B["2. HEARTBEAT
heartbeat() resets the period
(gas limit of 50,000 or more)"]
  C["3. TRIGGER
The period runs out with no heartbeat:
anyone calls trigger()
and the 369-block wait begins"]
  R["4. RELEASE
After 369 blocks (about 1 hour),
release() moves the protected tokens
from your wallet to the heir"]
  A --> B
  B -- "still alive: you repeat the heartbeat" --> B
  B -- "no heartbeat in time" --> C
  C -- "can no longer be stopped" --> R
  classDef arm fill:#0f2232,stroke:#5dade2,color:#e7e9f7
  classDef ok fill:#0f2a1b,stroke:#2ecc71,color:#e7e9f7
  classDef warn fill:#2c1d05,stroke:#f39c12,color:#e7e9f7
  classDef end1 fill:#1d1838,stroke:#e65bf0,color:#e7e9f7
  class A arm
  class B ok
  class C warn
  class R end1
